WEBVTT

00:37:26.579 --> 00:37:30.704
There's this one Yankees fan who's OK,
but he's not like the other ones.

00:37:30.704 --> 00:37:31.954
And I still hate all the rest of them.

00:37:32.913 --> 00:37:37.454
So what ultimately ended up working
and in a way that I was

00:37:37.454 --> 00:37:40.829
I was surprised by the power of it
actually was saying, look, you know,

00:37:41.038 --> 00:37:45.079
maybe we just need to get people to
rethink how they became fans in

00:37:45.079 --> 00:37:48.538
the first place. So imagine if
you had grown up in New York.

00:37:49.329 --> 00:37:52.454
Would you possibly root for the now
you're probably root for the Mets.

00:37:52.704 --> 00:37:55.163
But the point is, you might
not be a Red Sox fan.

00:37:55.204 --> 00:37:58.538
I'm not crazy. Exactly. I'm joking.
I'm joking.

00:37:58.746 --> 00:38:01.704
All my Mets fans, friends, I'm joking.
I don't know if you are, but go on.